at sie nennt; bayerische, hessische und Teile der thüringischen „Heilbäder“ ohne Artangabe. Stände: NI 04/2026, BY 01/2020, NW 07/2026, SN 09/2019, HE 04/2026, TH 01/2017, ST 03/2024, BB 07/2026, BW/RP/SH/MV 10/2026 (Beihilfe-Verzeichnis des Landes Berlin, das alle Länder aufführt). Lage NI/BY/NW/SN/BW/RP/SH/MV aus GeoNames, HE/TH/ST/BB aus Wikidata. Das Saarland hat keinen Ort mit Heilmittel-Prädikat (nur Kneipp- bzw. heilklimatische Kurorte). Bad Tönisstein (nur im Berliner Verzeichnis, nicht in der Liste des Landes Rheinland-Pfalz von 2018) ist weggelassen.","daten":[{"n":"Bad Bentheim","land":"NI","praedikat":"Mineralheilbad","art":"Mineralquelle","lon":7.16,"lat":52.32,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Bevensen","land":"NI","praedikat":"Jod-Sole-Heilbad","art":"Sole (Jod)","lon":10.58,"lat":53.08,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Eilsen","land":"NI","praedikat":"Ort mit Heilquellen-Kurbetrieb","art":"Heilquelle","lon":9.1,"lat":52.24,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Essen","land":"NI","praedikat":"Ort mit Sole-Kurbetrieb","art":"Sole","lon":8.33,"lat":52.32,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Grund","land":"NI","praedikat":"Ort mit Heilstollen-Kurbetrieb","art":"Heilstollen","lon":10.24,"lat":51.81,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Harzburg","land":"NI","praedikat":"Soleheilbad","art":"Sole","lon":10.56,"lat":51.88,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Laer","land":"NI","praedikat":"Soleheilbad","art":"Sole","lon":8.08,"lat":52.1,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Nenndorf","land":"NI","praedikat":"Moorheilbad, Mineralheilbad, Thermalheilbad","art":"Thermal, Mineral, Moor","lon":9.38,"lat":52.34,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Pyrmont","land":"NI","praedikat":"Moorheilbad, Mineralheilbad","art":"Mineralquelle, Moor","lon":9.25,"lat":51.99,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Rothenfelde","land":"NI","praedikat":"Soleheilbad","art":"Sole","lon":8.17,"lat":52.12,"stand":"13.04.2026"},{"n":"Bad Salzdetfurth","land":"NI","praedikat":"Soleheilbad, Moorheilbad","art":"Sole, Moor","lon":10.01